{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1000_null", "source_sha256": "9ae402f0bd63d4e5669b21d53d4c788695a03bf42b7cfd4c710d427175d5f399", "ja": "1週間後……", "zh": "1周后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1001_p", "source_sha256": "04326cd5b357092a4e264e26121d03f4f2b4565700d84a87ecb90d8d64da045b", "ja": "（茜に招待され、公演のメンバー達と茜の学校の\n学園祭にやってきた。すごい活気だな……！）", "zh": "（受茜邀请，我和公演成员们一起来到了茜的学校参加校园祭。真是热闹啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "1b7d95003fbfb21a27ecfe6a800a4de14707a19d0d7de5ee5f29f8a838ee31c4", "ja": "つむりーん！　早く早く～！\nあっちの図書室でも、怪談やってるんだって！", "zh": "紬——！快点快点～！\n听说那边的图书室也在讲怪谈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1e5246e82191613e5fe47a09403abe3c20aa10261eb8094140022b13d04cc2de", "ja": "ま、待ってください、亜美さん……！\nお化け屋敷が、思ったより……うぅ。", "zh": "等、等一下，亚美小姐……！\n鬼屋比我想的还要……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "9c70a5a161cb64ef1df7a1155a21ab46a1b15c607daa5dd7f1852b4016847030", "ja": "へー、けっこうにぎやかじゃん♪　あ、みてみて歩、\nたこ焼き売ってるよ。みんなの分買っちゃお。", "zh": "哎——，还挺热闹的嘛♪　啊，快看，步，卖章鱼烧的。买些给大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6a6bf1996589e43d648bebb766a1bb0c194b388bf7fcac64e83b0f61472024e5", "ja": "うん、おいしそう！　……高校の学園祭とか、そんな\n昔の話じゃないのに、なんか懐かしい気がするな～。", "zh": "嗯，看起来好好吃！……明明高中的文化祭\n也不是那么久以前的事，却总觉得好怀念啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1abe7f83e9b9933001b5348b5d6ebefe9b0314b3320b9f64c82586773954ddfa", "ja": "おーい、みんな～！　そろそろ茜の\nライブが始まるみたいだから、ステージに向かおう。", "zh": "喂——大家～！茜的演唱会好像马上就要开始了，我们去舞台那边吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1007_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "a9550c6761a2ee3fb25e06d271273502dd80b894633fdea9a0234d87cfa20d59", "ja": "あ、こんにちは！　みなさん、学園祭へようこそ。\n今日は思いっきり、楽しんでいってくださいね！", "zh": "啊，你好！大家欢迎来到学园祭。\n今天请尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5d79b94c08150dc41cd5f48e2f9f4352da4924ec40fd1105658717f1ecfddfd4", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\n……おっ、次がちょうど茜の出番みたいだな。", "zh": "嗯，谢谢。\n……哦，接下来正好轮到茜上场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "c7b3813c79a313009be1af7ebc38dade600c565b4c09ecda668c85f4e8c4b2bd", "ja": "イエーイッ☆　勤勉かつ品行方正な学生諸君！\n学園祭実行委員長の、野々原茜ちゃんだよ～！", "zh": "耶——☆　勤奋又品行端正的同学们！\n我是学园祭执行委员会委员长，野野原小茜哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1010_seitotachi", "source_sha256": "e38fd3a5eaf1b3daee5682416cebf94103a8f8e60a00dba3c4476d7f42787c9b", "ja": "ヒュー！！", "zh": "呼——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "faacc8093393262df262ceced0ee18b1af2a14940c8328086c1121072b625d7c", "ja": "茜ちゃん実は……こう見えてアイドルもやってるんだ！\nなんて、みんなとっくに知ってたよね！", "zh": "小茜其实……别看我这样，我也是偶像哦！不过，大家早就知道了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "f7f04b4f0b7e4e835c279e78ee4db0033a77ab94c872a5abf9ca1990ef797ae5", "ja": "というわけで、今日はここから茜ちゃんオンステージ！\nみんな、思いっきりテンション上げてこうね～！", "zh": "所以，今天就从这里开始小茜登台演出！\n大家尽情嗨起来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1013_students", "source_sha256": "f6076b52aa253d124326282e521dc8e3c83a1c237b09fef1997b7ae078749a5b", "ja": "わああああーっ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "79e66491900cd6d8e04920023adbc526461c4f40c2bbbef7fc4009a83d97629d", "ja": "おっとぉ！？　あそこにいるのは茜ちゃんと同じ、\n765プロライブ劇場のアイドルじゃないかぁー！", "zh": "哎呀！？那边的不是和小茜一样，来自765专业现场剧场的偶像吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "0f6c3ce0c608e773505d8eecb8cd159bb6350e72c71a06e13d41b6954c2714d8", "ja": "というわけで、劇場のみんなも応援に来てくれました！\nほらほら、ステージに上がっちゃって！　カモン！", "zh": "所以，剧场的大家也来给我加油了！\n快快快，上台来！来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1017_students", "source_sha256": "f6076b52aa253d124326282e521dc8e3c83a1c237b09fef1997b7ae078749a5b", "ja": "わああああーっ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "a38eede975fefe7b2ba8fce50a0626fa1d97f38469a51682cea3c6ab1cfb9e94", "ja": "ありゃ。これって、アタシたちも出なきゃいけない\nカンジ？　みんな、メッチャ盛り上がってるし。", "zh": "哎呀。这个意思是，我们也得上场吗？大家都已经嗨到不行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4e2ae8a0760d90c16f3ac24359e820de72904a85e97419177377b0396b613169", "ja": "やられた……\n茜のやつ、最初からこれを狙って……！", "zh": "被摆了一道……\n茜这家伙，从一开始就是冲着这个来的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "be4361afb3c1bd6eac20c23c1cc1141d9d18466b7a15d818cfe85fdbab9f3720", "ja": "ど、どうする？　{$P$}。学校の\n許可とか取ってないけど、勝手に出ていいのかな～。", "zh": "怎、怎么办？{$P$}。虽然还没取得学校的许可，但就这样擅自出去真的可以吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "edb039604ca0716eb052b8809236986808f3f8ee572fa1830b7887764538eeef", "ja": "いいじゃんいいじゃん、行こうよ！\n亜美は、どんな挑戦でも受けるかんね！　レッツゴー！", "zh": "有什么关系嘛，去吧去吧！\n不管什么挑战亚美都会接下的！出发咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "960d976612d77e65d5bffbc999b8e274606a2b96755ed052372a343b04d5a190", "ja": "あ、ああっ、{$P$}！\n亜美さんがひとりで……！", "zh": "啊、啊啊，{$P$}！\n亜美一个人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a3e2048fdefe7eb3c20bb33096ed147c81363d37bcc62fdce5e85de060a87ca0", "ja": "ふぅ……これはもう、しょうがないな。\n恵美、歩、紬、お願いできるか？", "zh": "呼……这已经没办法了。\n惠美、步、紬，能拜托你们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "85e85bd5e0f71c598db43e37f3ad4b7855389b1c439c11db24ff902e5823f61c", "ja": "おっけ～♪", "zh": "好～的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3bd143e3945a1f815873d94a793429d0c1e2149cc5f533b0c3fbe3136dff8bc8", "ja": "オッケー！", "zh": "OK！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1027_p", "source_sha256": "1671c4975aef265cd5bc488450bcd671d54158de1625fadce6c1daa4384f9466", "ja": "（しっかり成長したようで、何をしてくるか予想が\nつかない。そんなところも、茜の魅力なんだろう）", "zh": "（看来她确实成长了不少，已经让人猜不出她会做出什么事来。或许，这也是茜的魅力所在吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_086_1028_p", "source_sha256": "021d8292a1b43caf72cb6613847a7e5256757a217124cf51688e728054d003ea", "ja": "（けど、このままやられっぱなしというのも良くないな\n……あとで4人のギャラを、茜に請求しておこう！）", "zh": "（不过，一直这样挨打也不太好……回头把4人份的酬劳向茜要回来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
